      "role": "assistant",
      "reasoning": "Correct intuition: zero-product property. Now ask them to set each factor equal to zero and solve for x. [TOOL CHECK: calculator(expression=\"-5 + 5\") -> 0, calculator(expression=\"2 - 2\") -> 0]",
      "content": "Presies! Stel nou elke faktor gelyk aan nul en los op vir $x$:\n1. $x + 5 = 0$  $\\rightarrow$  $x = ?$\n2. $x - 2 = 0$  $\\rightarrow$  $x = ?$"
